    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="section" id="faq">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head section-head--center">
          <span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
          <h2>Answers before you call</h2>
          <p>Practical information, without the marketing jargon.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How quickly can you get to me?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>It depends on where you are, the traffic and how busy it is at that moment. When you call, we'll give you an honest estimate before we book anything, not a promise we can't keep.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Will I get a price upfront?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes. Tell us where the vehicle is, where it needs to go, the make and model and what's happened, and we can usually give you a price straight away.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>When can the price change?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Only if the situation or the distance turns out to be clearly different from what was described to us. For example, the car is somewhere else, or it needs extra equipment we weren't told about.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can you take my car to a garage?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes. To a garage, your home, a dealer or any other address you choose, locally or long distance.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do you recover vans and light commercial vehicles?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes. Tell us the size of the van and roughly how heavily it's loaded, so the right recovery vehicle is sent.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Can you help at night and at weekends?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Yes. Our phone and WhatsApp are answered 24 hours a day, every day, including bank holidays.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What's the difference between breakdown recovery and roadside assistance?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Roadside assistance covers problems that can often be fixed on the spot, like a flat battery or a puncture. Breakdown recovery is for when the vehicle can't safely be driven and needs to be taken somewhere else. Tell us what's happened and we'll advise which you need.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What should I do while I wait?<span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg></span></summary>
            <p>Hazard lights on and stay safe: behind the barrier on a fast road, or well away from traffic on a quieter one. On a motorway, read our guide to <a href="guides/smart-motorway-breakdown.html">breaking down on a smart motorway</a>. Keep your phone charged so we can reach you.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

